      "weight_min": null,
      "weight_max": null,
      "scars_and_marks": null,
      "remarks": null,
      "details": "<p>The Federal Bureau of Investigation's Norfolk Field Office in Virginia, and the United States Postal Inspection Service, are seeking information regarding the armed robbery of the New York Jewelry Store located in the Greenbrier Mall in Chesapeake, Virginia.\u00a0 On October 9, 2025, at approximately 3:30 p.m.,\u00a0two unknown suspects robbed the store of a large amount of gold jewelry.\u00a0 During the robbery, two US Postal Mail Carriers who were in the store delivering mail were also robbed at gunpoint of personal property and their mail scanner.\u00a0 The two suspects fled on foot.</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>The first suspect is described as a\u00a0Black male wearing white sweatpants, a dark hoodie with a white shirt underneath, and a dark-colored hat.</p>\r\n<p>The second suspect is described as a\u00a0Black male wearing a blue sport coat and pants, a pink dress shirt, a dark-colored top hat, sunglasses, and a medical mask.</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>The public is encouraged to share any personal videos or photos taken at, or around, the mall near the time of the robbery. These videos and photos can be shared at <a data-urltype=\"/view\" data-val=\"https://tips.fbi.gov/digitalmedia/4267f3c4793b484\" href=\"https://tips.fbi.gov/digitalmedia/4267f3c4793b484\" data-linktype=\"external\">FBI \u2014 Seeking Information on the New York Jewelers Armed Robbery at Greenbrier Mall</a>.</p>",
      "caution": null,
