      "dates_of_birth_used": [
        "June 1, 1971"
      ],
      "place_of_birth": "Egypt",
      "sex": "Male",
      "race": "white",
      "hair": "brown",
      "eyes": "green",
      "height_min": 72,
      "height_max": 72,
      "weight": "170 to 180 pounds",
      "weight_min": 170,
      "weight_max": 180,
      "scars_and_marks": null,
      "remarks": "<p>Kandil has dual United States and Egyptian citizenship.</p>",
      "details": "<p>Ahmed Abdallah Taha\u00a0Kandil\u00a0is wanted for international parental kidnapping pursuant to an arrest warrant issued on November 21, 2014,\u00a0in\u00a0the United States\u00a0District Court, Eastern District of Virginia.\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>In 2014,\u00a0Kandil\u00a0and his estranged wife each resided in James City County, Virginia,\u00a0and shared joint custody of their two children, <a data-urltype=\"/view\" data-val=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/kidnap/amina-and-belel-kandil\" href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/kidnap/amina-and-belel-kandil\" data-linktype=\"external\">Amina and Belel Kandil</a>.\u00a0\u00a0On August 29, 2014,\u00a0Kandil\u00a0picked up the children from his estranged\u00a0wife\u2019s home and advised her that he was taking them to visit his sister out of town and they would return before school started.\u00a0\u00a0Instead, he and the children flew out of JFK airport in New York, to\u00a0Boryspil, Ukraine,\u00a0and then to Ataturk, Turkey,\u00a0and never returned.\u00a0 On September 5, 2014, the Circuit Court of Williamsburg\u00a0and\u00a0James City County granted the children\u2019s mother immediate sole\u00a0and\u00a0legal custody.\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>Kandil\u00a0and his children\u00a0may be living in the Alexandria, Cairo or Giza areas of Egypt, or the Hatay region of Turkey.\u00a0</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
      "caution": null,
      "description": "International Parental Kidnapping",
      "modified": "2026-09-28T14:59:25+00:00",
      "publication": "2020-03-24T12:58:00",
      "images": [
        {
          "large": "https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/parental-kidnappings/ahmed-abdallah-taha-kandil/@@images/image/large",
          "caption": null,
          "thumb": "https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/parental-kidnappings/ahmed-abdallah-taha-kandil/@@images/image/thumb",
